Z||000005||862M4inCA||03-11-2001||01:10 PM||||That would be some good information. I have a few body panels I need to replace due to a previous (minor) accident the previous owner had. I'm basically looking for the rear bumper, right rear quarter panel and trim including the wheel well splash guard, and front left fender. I MIGHT have to replace the rear clip but damage was VERY minimal so a little fiberglass work might be all I need to do. If anyone out there has these parts already available (I'm looking for red panels since I don't plan to repaint the car for a while) I'd be interesting to know how much they'd be willing to get rid of them for. Ah, before I forget, bit of important information hehehe, it's an 86 notchback.||||reg||1
